# ── API routing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# GATEWAY MODE (full three-layer enforcement):
#   Uncomment the line below when ALL Python services are running:
#     - API gateway     :8000
#     - Auth service    :8001  (returns role-correct JWTs via demo_* fields)
#     - Inventory svc   :8004  (handles /api/v1/transfers + /api/v1/inventory)
#   demo-auth.ts will exchange a JWT on login and api.ts will send it as Bearer.
#
# BFF MODE (default for local demo — currently active):
#   routes at /api/v1/... which handle demo state in-process without JWT.
#
